From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zerollama <zerollama@local>
Date: Tue, 14 Jul 2026 17:36:05 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add llama_context_cuda_graph_invalidate and POST
 /cuda-graph/invalidate.

Clear ggml CUDA graph cache after L3/prefix-cache KV clears so stale
topology-keyed graphs cannot replay. Export via CUDA backend proc_address
for dynamic backends; server task queue mirrors slot erase serialization.
